COMPND   6 OTHER_DETAILS: HUMAN NETRIN-1 EXPRESSED IN HEK293T CELLS USING THE   
COMPND   7 PHLSEC VECTOR FOR SECRETED PROTEINS. CONTAINS C-TERMINAL RHO-1D4     
COMPND   8 TAG.;                                                                
COMPND   9 MOL_ID: 2;                                                           
COMPND  10 MOLECULE: NEOGENIN;                                                  
COMPND  11 CHAIN: B;                                                            
COMPND  12 ENGINEERED: YES;                                                     
