COMPND  34 ITS C-TERMINAL HIS6-TAG (TAG WAS CLEAVED DURING PURIFICATION USING 3C
COMPND  35 PROTEASE). IMPORTANTLY, FUNCTIONAL RGMB IS CLEAVED BY IN VIVO        
